ps://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105229#issuecomment-2796351162","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105229","id":2796351162,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6mrO66","user":{"login":"ysc-ysc-ysc","id":199900481,"node_id":"U_kgDOC-o9QQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/199900481?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ysc-ysc-ysc","html_url":"https://github.com/ysc-ysc-ysc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ysc-ysc-ysc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ysc-ysc-ysc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ysc-ysc-ysc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ysc-ysc-ysc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ysc-ysc-ysc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ysc-ysc-ysc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ysc-ysc-ysc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ysc-ysc-ysc/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ysc-ysc-ysc/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-11T09:27:27Z","updated_at":"2025-04-11T09:27:27Z","body":"I resolved the above error and the program ran successfully. The reason was that the .jar was not being exported in PR97908. I disregarded the version differences between 4.5 and 4.4.1, and completely porting it to 4.4.1 caused these errors. I solved the errors and got it running by using the original 4.4.1 export scheme, preserving the .jar export. However, I observed the adb logs and still found an error: ERROR: Can't open dynamic library: libmonosgen-2.0.so. Error: dlopen failed: library \"libmonosgen-2.0.so\" not found. I'd like to know if this error is normal, whether it will affect the program's execution, or if it can be ignored.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2796351162/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2796407382","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105229#issuecomment-2796407382","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105229","id":2796407382,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6mrcpW","user":{"login":"beicause","id":75941842,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1OTQxODQy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75941842?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause","html_url":"https://github.com/beicause","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-11T09:51:04Z","updated_at":"2025-04-11T09:51:04Z","body":">ERROR: Can't open dynamic library: libmonosgen-2.0.so. Error: dlopen failed: library \"libmonosgen-2.0.so\"\n\nI also encountered this error before. I think it's harmless.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2796407382/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2797537833","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105229#issuecomment-2797537833","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105229","id":2797537833,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6mvwop","user":{"login":"raulsntos","id":3903059,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5MDMwNTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3903059?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos","html_url":"https://github.com/raulsntos","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-11T17:19:17Z","updated_at":"2025-04-11T17:19:17Z","body":"> The reason was that the .jar was not being exported in PR97908\n\nWhat .jar are you referring to? Publishing NativeAOT doesn't export any .jar files.\n\n> > ERROR: Can't open dynamic library: libmonosgen-2.0.so. Error: dlopen failed: library \"libmonosgen-2.0.so\"\n>\n> I also encountered this error before. I think it's harmless.\n\nYes, it's harmless. It's because we first try to load `libmonosgen-2.0.so` and only when that fails we fall back to NativeAOT. In other platforms we may be able to check if the native library `.so` exists before trying to open it and avoid the error, but that's not always feasible.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2797537833/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5816939770","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105229#issuecomment-5816939770","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105229","id":5816939770,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABWrd0-g","user":{"login":"raulsntos","id":3903059,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5MDMwNTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3903059?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos","html_url":"https://github.com/raulsntos","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-24T15:19:24Z","updated_at":"2026-09-24T15:19:24Z","body":"Closing as per the last comments, since it seems the questions were resolved. Let us know if you are still having trouble exporting to Android, and we can reopen the issue.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5816939770/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]